03:58 - The market share decline & rising competition
04:27 - Maruti’s late EV entry
05:05 - Growth strategy: New models, hybrids & flexible manufacturing
07:22 - Strong balance sheet & valuation reset
09:31 - Final verdict: Losing grip or ready to fight back?
10:01 - Outro

